# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets redirect rules.
# Next copies public/ into out/ verbatim, so this ships with the export.
#
# /parties and /corporate previously existed as re-export duplicates of the
# canonical /events/* routes, which published byte-identical pages at two URLs.
# The duplicates are gone; these 301s preserve any existing inbound links.
/parties/    /events/parties/    301
/parties     /events/parties/    301
/corporate/  /events/corporate/  301
/corporate   /events/corporate/  301
